@startuml
!theme plain
title Lecturer Support Agent - Multi-Provider AI Gateway

actor User
rectangle "Unified AI Work Area" as UI
rectangle "AI Orchestrator" as ORCH
rectangle "Policy and Capability Router" as ROUTER
rectangle "Source Verification" as SOURCE
rectangle "Output Validators" as VALID
rectangle "Model Registry and Health" as REG

cloud "OpenAI" as OPENAI
cloud "Anthropic Claude" as CLAUDE
cloud "Google Gemini" as GEMINI
cloud "DeepSeek API" as DEEPSEEK
node "Institution-Controlled Host" {
  rectangle "Ollama API" as OLLAMA
  database "Local Model Store" as MODELS
  OLLAMA --> MODELS
}

User --> UI
UI --> ORCH
ORCH --> ROUTER
ROUTER --> REG
ROUTER --> OPENAI : approved cloud route
ROUTER --> CLAUDE : approved cloud route
ROUTER --> GEMINI : approved cloud route
ROUTER --> DEEPSEEK : approved cloud route
ROUTER --> OLLAMA : approved local route
OPENAI --> ORCH
CLAUDE --> ORCH
GEMINI --> ORCH
DEEPSEEK --> ORCH
OLLAMA --> ORCH
ORCH --> SOURCE
ORCH --> VALID
VALID --> UI

note right of ROUTER
No ordinary-user model selector.
Data class, capability, tenant policy,
quality, health, latency and cost decide.
Fallback may not weaken privacy.
end note

note bottom of SOURCE
Displayed citations require genuinely
retrieved and verified source records,
independent of the generation provider.
end note
@enduml
